      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To counter concerns about side effects, emphasize that CardioZen's consistent trial data shows a 20% lower incidence of adverse events compared to the competitor, which significantly outweighs the minor risks. Frame the occasional side effects as manageable and less persistent for most patients, redirecting the conversation to your superior efficacy and faster clinical outcomes that drive real patient recovery. By focusing on the robust evidence supporting your safety and performance metrics, doctors can feel confident in maintaining current patient care plans without hesitation.",
